  "lead": "\"Wide Awake\" is a song by American singer-songwriter Katy Perry from Teenage Dream: The Complete Confection (2012), the reissue of her third studio album, Teenage Dream (2010). She co-wrote the song with Max Martin and Bonnie McKee, alongside its producers Dr. Luke and Cirkut. The song was recorded at NightBird Studios, based in West Hollywood, California. It was specifically written for Perry's autobiographical film Katy Perry: Part of Me (2012). Capitol Records released the song onto radio stations on May 22, 2012. The track is a power ballad styled in dance-pop, and features lyrics about the reality of a break up and moving forward.",
